avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59734?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor","html_url":"https://github.com/sonukapoor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-04-09T20:28:38Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/619623089","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/36539#issuecomment-619623089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/36539","id":619623089,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYxOTYyMzA4OQ==","user":{"login":"sonukapoor","id":59734,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NzM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59734?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor","html_url":"https://github.com/sonukapoor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-04-26T20:51:46Z","updated_at":"2020-04-26T20:51:46Z","body":"@gkalpak please see the below inline questions:\r\n\r\n> One possible solution is be to:\r\n> \r\n> 1. Detect this situation in the SW (i.e. when a hashed, eagerly cached asset cannot be found in the cache and also does not exist on the server).\r\n> 2. Purge the corresponding cache.\r\n\r\nIf the asset doesn't exist in the cache anymore, then nothing needs to be purged. Is that my correct understanding?\r\n\r\n> 3. Communicate from the SW to the page that the SW and the app are in an unrecoverable state and the page needs to be reloaded.\r\n\r\nWould you recommend to use an `Observable` so that the page can be notified of this state?\r\n\r\n> 4. Have the page listen for the message and handle it accordingly. For example it could show a notification to the user prompting them to reload) or automatically reload the page. (For angular.io, the latter would make more sense, since there is basically no app state to be lost.)\r\n\r\nAgain, would an `Observable` here be sufficient?\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/619623089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sonukapoor","id":59734,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NzM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59734?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor","html_url":"https://github.com/sonukapoor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonukapoor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonu